        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jem Finer, Falco\n- Organizations: The Pogues\n- Works: Misty Morning, Albert Bridge; Peace and Love; Longplayer; Hoch wie nie\n\nFacts:\n- Jem Finer was one of the founding members of The Pogues.\n- Jem Finer composed \"Misty Morning, Albert Bridge,\" and the song was featured on The Pogues' fourth album, \"Peace and Love.\"\n- Longplayer is a self-extending composition by Jem Finer that is designed to continue for one thousand years.\n- The Longplayer was published on Falco's 50th birthday.",
